{"seq":4,"slug":"workspace-management","title":"工作区管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/editors-compilers/lsp-and-dev-tools/lsp-specification/workspace-management","wordCount":1036,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"工作区管理\">工作区管理</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>工作区管理把 LSP 从「单文件工具」提升为「项目级工具」。服务端要跨文件理解代码，必须建立对<strong>整个工作区的全局视角</strong>，这需要解决三类问题：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>对应能力</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>项目边界在哪</td>\n<td>workspaceFolders（多根目录）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>服务端的行为如何配置</td>\n<td>配置管理（推送/拉取/混合）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件系统变了服务端怎么知道</td>\n<td>文件监听（glob 模式）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何跨文件修改代码</td>\n<td>工作区编辑（WorkspaceEdit）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>如何在项目中查找符号</td>\n<td>工作区符号（workspace/symbol）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这些能力的共同点是：它们都要求服务端维护一个比「当前打开的文件」更大的状态——这也正是语言服务器内存占用的主要来源。</p>\n<h2 id=\"workspacefolders\">workspaceFolders</h2><p>现代开发常涉及多根目录工作区（multi-root workspace）。LSP 3.6 引入了 <code>workspaceFolders</code> 能力，允许客户端通知服务端工作区中的所有根文件夹及其变更。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface WorkspaceFolder {&#10;  uri: string;&#10;  name: string;&#10;}&#10;&#10;interface WorkspaceFoldersChangeEvent {&#10;  added: WorkspaceFolder[];&#10;  removed: WorkspaceFolder[];&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  uri</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFoldersChangeEvent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  added</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  removed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> WorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant C as 客户端&#10;    participant S as 服务端&#10;&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (workspaceFolders: [A, B])&#10;    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized&#10;    Note over C,S: 用户添加文件夹 C&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: workspace/didChangeWorkspaceFolders&#10;    Note right of S: added: [C], removed: []&#10;    Note right of S: 为文件夹 C 建立索引&#10;    Note over C,S: 用户移除文件夹 A&#10;    C-&gt;&gt;S: workspace/didChangeWorkspaceFolders&#10;    Note right of S: added: [], removed: [A]&#10;    Note right of S: 清理文件夹 A 的缓存\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant C as 客户端\n    participant S as 服务端\n\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialize (workspaceFolders: [A, B])\n    S--&gt;&gt;C: InitializeResult\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: initialized\n    Note over C,S: 用户添加文件夹 C\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: workspace/didChangeWorkspaceFolders\n    Note right of S: added: [C], removed: []\n    Note right of S: 为文件夹 C 建立索引\n    Note over C,S: 用户移除文件夹 A\n    C-&gt;&gt;S: workspace/didChangeWorkspaceFolders\n    Note right of S: added: [], removed: [A]\n    Note right of S: 清理文件夹 A 的缓存</pre><p>服务端声明对 workspaceFolders 的支持：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const capabilities: ServerCapabilities = {&#10;  workspace: {&#10;    workspaceFolders: {&#10;      supported: true,&#10;      changeNotifications: true,&#10;    },&#10;  },&#10;};&#10;&#10;connection.onDidChangeWorkspaceFolders((event) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const added of event.added) {&#10;    indexWorkspaceFolder(added.uri);&#10;  }&#10;  for (const removed of event.removed) {&#10;    removeWorkspaceIndex(removed.uri);&#10;  }&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> capabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ServerCapabilities</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  workspace: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    workspaceFolders: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      supported: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      changeNotifications: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onDidChangeWorkspaceFolders</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">event</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> added</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.added) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    indexWorkspaceFolder</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(added.uri);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> removed</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event.removed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    removeWorkspaceIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(removed.uri);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始化时传入</td>\n<td>在 initializeParams 中提供</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>动态查询</td>\n<td>服务端发送 workspace/workspaceFolders 请求</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件夹添加</td>\n<td>didChangeWorkspaceFolders 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件夹移除</td>\n<td>didChangeWorkspaceFolders 通知</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不支持时的回退</td>\n<td>使用 rootUri 作为单根目录</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 始终优先使用 <code>workspaceFolders</code> 而非已废弃的 <code>rootPath</code>。即使只有一个根目录，也应通过 <code>workspaceFolders</code> 传递以保持一致性。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"配置管理\">配置管理</h2><p>LSP 支持双向的配置管理：客户端可以通知服务端配置变更，服务端也可以主动拉取特定配置项。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"connection.onDidChangeConfiguration((params) =&gt; {&#10;  if (hasConfigurationCapability) {&#10;    documentSettings.clear();&#10;  } else {&#10;    globalSettings = params.settings?.myLanguageServer ?? defaultSettings;&#10;  }&#10;  revalidateAllDocuments();&#10;});&#10;&#10;async function getDocumentSettings(resource: string): Promise&lt;LanguageSettings&gt; {&#10;  if (!hasConfigurationCapability) {&#10;    return globalSettings;&#10;  }&#10;  let result = documentSettings.get(resource);&#10;  if (!result) {&#10;    result = await connection.workspace.getConfiguration({&#10;      scopeUri: resource,&#10;      section: &#39;myLanguageServer&#39;,&#10;    });&#10;    documentSettings.set(resource, result);&#10;  }&#10;  return result;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">connection.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">onDidChangeConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">params</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (hasConfigurationCapability) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    documentSettings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">clear</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    globalSettings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> params.settings?.myLanguageServer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> defaultSettings;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  revalidateAllDocuments</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getDocumentSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resource</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LanguageSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">hasConfigurationCapability) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> globalSettings;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> documentSettings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resource);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">result) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> connection.workspace.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getConfiguration</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      scopeUri: resource,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      section: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'myLanguageServer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    documentSettings.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resource, result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 推送模式&#10;        USER1[用户修改设置] --&gt; CLIENT1[客户端]&#10;        CLIENT1 --&gt;|didChangeConfiguration| SERVER1[服务端]&#10;        SERVER1 --&gt; REVALIDATE1[重新验证所有文档]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 拉取模式&#10;        SERVER2[服务端需要配置] --&gt;|workspace/configuration| CLIENT2[客户端]&#10;        CLIENT2 --&gt;|返回配置值| SERVER2&#10;        SERVER2 --&gt; USE[使用配置]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph 推送模式\n        USER1[用户修改设置] --&gt; CLIENT1[客户端]\n        CLIENT1 --&gt;|didChangeConfiguration| SERVER1[服务端]\n        SERVER1 --&gt; REVALIDATE1[重新验证所有文档]\n    end\n    subgraph 拉取模式\n        SERVER2[服务端需要配置] --&gt;|workspace/configuration| CLIENT2[客户端]\n        CLIENT2 --&gt;|返回配置值| SERVER2\n        SERVER2 --&gt; USE[使用配置]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>请求/通知</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>推送模式</td>\n<td>客户端→服务端</td>\n<td>didChangeConfiguration 通知</td>\n<td>全局配置变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拉取模式</td>\n<td>服务端→客户端</td>\n<td>workspace/configuration 请求</td>\n<td>按文档/作用域获取配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合模式</td>\n<td>双向</td>\n<td>推送触发 + 拉取获取</td>\n<td>推荐的最佳实践</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 推荐使用&quot;混合模式&quot;：监听 <code>didChangeConfiguration</code> 通知清除缓存，然后在需要时通过 <code>workspace/configuration</code> 按需拉取。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"文件监听\">文件监听</h2><p>语言服务器经常需要监听工作区内文件系统的变化，例如 <code>tsconfig.json</code> 修改、<code>package.json</code> 依赖变更等。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"connection.client.register(DidChangeWatchedFilesNotification.type, {&#10;  watchers: [&#10;    { globPattern: &#39;**/tsconfig*.json&#39; },&#10;    { globPattern: &#39;**/package.json&#39; },&#10;    { globPattern: &#39;**/*.{ts,tsx}&#39; },&#10;  ],&#10;});&#10;&#10;connection.onDidChangeWatchedFiles((params) =&gt; {&#10;  for (const change of params.changes) {&#10;    switch (change.type) {&#10;      case FileChangeType.Created:&#10;        handleFileCreated(change.uri);&#10;        break;&#10;      case FileChangeType.Changed:&#10;        handleFileChanged(change.uri);&#10;        break;&#10;      case FileChangeType.Deleted:&#10;        handleFileDeleted(change.uri);&#10; 